  "info": {
    "title": "MICROSERVICE_DEV_SIM Swap Management API",
    "description": "The SIM Swap Management API facilitates the management of SIM card swaps for mobile subscribers. This powerful endpoint allows authorized users to initiate SIM swap requests, ensuring a seamless transfer of services between SIM cards. Typical users include customer service agents and account managers who need to assist customers with changing their SIM cards due to loss, upgrade, or service changes. By streamlining the process, the API enhances customer satisfaction and operational efficiency.",
