        "tags": [
          "SIM Management"
        ],
        "summary": "Initiate a SIM swap.",
        "description": "This endpoint allows you to initiate a SIM swap process for the specified user. A SIM swap is the act of transferring a phone number from one SIM card to another, which is typically done to change carriers or replace a damaged SIM. Ensure to provide the necessary details to complete the transaction.",
